{"id":"cdecf2529365d61b","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-gl-tableau-order.md","title":"Why Tableau Windows Need Propositional Saturation","display":"ex-gl-tableau-order — Why Tableau Windows Need Propositional Saturation","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-gl-tableau-order","aliases":["89-ex-gl-tableau-order"],"display":"ex-gl-tableau-order — Why Tableau Windows Need Propositional Saturation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-gl-tableau-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-gl-tableau-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-tableau-order — Why Tableau Windows Need Propositional Saturation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59e94f1adddc4fdd\" href=\"?note=59e94f1adddc4fdd\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure\">89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=p\\land\\top\">\\(D=p\\land\\top\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\neg\\Box D\\land(\\Box p\\land\\top)\">\\(C=\\neg\\Box D\\land(\\Box p\\land\\top)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\neg C\">\\(A=\\neg C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为既有 GL 交集闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ne v\">\\(r\\ne v\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}\">\\(\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}\\)</span> 表示从本书真值树规则中仅删去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span> 守卫得到的旧任意次序关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Open}\">\\(\\mathsf{Open}\\)</span> 分别指该旧关系无可继续步骤和既有开放性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\{r,v\\},\\{(r,v)\\},V)\">\\(M=(\\{r,v\\},\\{(r,v)\\},V)\\)</span>，所有字母的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(q)=\\varnothing\">\\(V(q)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(T_A^0\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}^*T\\land\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Open}(T)),\\\\\n&amp;M,r\\not\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,r\\models A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(T_A^0\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}^*T\\land\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Open}(T)),\\\\\n&amp;M,r\\not\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,r\\models A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本库对旧规则的反例，不是原书的例题。原书 pp.139、142–146 的命题/模态阶段及开放真值证明给出本次核对依据。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span> 是命题重言式；K 正规性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\leftrightarrow\\Box D\">\\(\\Box p\\leftrightarrow\\Box D\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 可被 K 否定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 已是 K 定理。</p>\n<p>从初始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\neg\\neg C\">\\(\\neg A=\\neg\\neg C\\)</span> 先展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，再展开最外合取，父分支含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box D\">\\(\\neg\\Box D\\)</span> 和尚未展开的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\land\\top\">\\(\\Box p\\land\\top\\)</span>。若立即为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box D\">\\(\\neg\\Box D\\)</span> 建窗口，窗口只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg D,\\Box D\">\\(\\neg D,\\Box D\\)</span>，遗漏 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\Box p\">\\(p,\\Box p\\)</span>。之后展开父分支的合取，加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p,\\top\">\\(\\Box p,\\top\\)</span>；再将窗口的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(p\\land\\top)\">\\(\\neg(p\\land\\top)\\)</span> 分叉，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\top\">\\(\\neg\\top\\)</span> 那条闭合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg p\">\\(\\neg p\\)</span> 那条保持开放。完成双重否定等剩余命题步骤后，全部可用规则都已处理，旧树仍开放。</p>\n<p>按旧开放树提取的二世界模型正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>：后继的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为假，父分支标出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 却不真；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 本身真，无法得到反模型。因此“任意旧重写到开放饱和树即可反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>”为假。现有守卫禁止过早窗口步：先加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 后，窗口含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\Box p,\\neg D,\\Box D\">\\(p,\\Box p,\\neg D,\\Box D\\)</span>，两条分叉均闭合，得到正确的闭树结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"D=p\\land\\top","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\neg\\Box D\\land(\\Box p\\land\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\neg C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\ne v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Open}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\{r,v\\},\\{(r,v)\\},V)","display":false},{"tex":"V(q)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(T_A^0\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}^*T\\land\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Open}(T)),\\\\\n&M,r\\not\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,r\\models A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\leftrightarrow\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\neg\\neg C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\land\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg D,\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"p,\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p,\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(p\\land\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"p,\\Box p,\\neg D,\\Box D","display":false}],"bytes":2409,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"修复第 10 章任意规则次序的反例：模态窗口规则正式要求本分支完成命题展开，并同步正盒继承、终止性、开放反模型和判定证明。见 [[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。"},{"id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PReady}(b)$ 仅表示本分支的三个命题规则已全部处理；字母、负字母、底及正盒不要求检查标记。首次建窗口以后，父分支不再增加公式，后续模态步只改变检查集及窗口序列，所以每个窗口继承的正盒清单就是父分支的最终正盒清单。不能只在 Remark 规定策略却让 $\\Rightarrow$ 允许任意顺序；去掉该守卫的明确反例见 [[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这些数值规约不用于替换算术解释内部的一阶 Gödel 编码。$\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}$、$\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}$ 仅在 [[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]] 中作局部反例记号。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反模型：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel]]。命题优先条件及旧任意次序的反例：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。关系树与高度界：[[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]。K 的补充：[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-k-lob-rule]]。"}],"outgoing":["59e94f1adddc4fdd","9f00301866fbd6f0","0006800fa1c85177"]}